      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"AnnotationBasedResourceDescription.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping\"><code>AnnotationBasedResourceDescription</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../annotation/Description.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.rest.core.annotation\"><code>Description</code></a> and fallback.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a href=\"../annotation/Description.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.rest.core.annotation 中的注解接口\"><code>Description</code></a> 和回退值创建一个新的 <a href=\"AnnotationBasedResourceDescription.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping 中的类\"><code>AnnotationBasedResourceDescription</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns whether this is the default description.",
