    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"ResourceDescription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping\"><code>ResourceDescription</code></a> that is customized based on a <a href=\"../annotation/Description.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.rest.core.annotation\"><code>Description</code></a> annotation. Allows to fall back on\nanother <a href=\"ResourceDescription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping\"><code>ResourceDescription</code></a> to provide defaults.",
      "translation": "一个基于<a href=\"../annotation/Description.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.rest.core.annotation 中的注解接口\"><code>Description</code></a>注解自定义的<a href=\"ResourceDescription.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>ResourceDescription</code></a>。允许回退到另一个<a href=\"ResourceDescription.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping 中的接口\"><code>ResourceDescription</code></a>以提供默认值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the description. This can be a message source code or a custom text format. Prefer resolving the\n<a href=\"ResourceDescription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping\"><code>ResourceDescription</code></a> using a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回描述信息。该描述可以是消息源代码或自定义文本格式。建议优先通过 <a href=\"ResourceDescription.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.rest.core.mapping\"><code>ResourceDescription</code></a> 接口，使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/MessageSource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>MessageSource</code></a> 类或接口进行解析。",
      "count": 1
    },
